{"event_type":"tool_call","timestamp":"2026-06-05T12:25:09.376672Z","session_id":"2026-05-15_155415","project_id":"opencode_cc_mem","source":"magnolia-run","tool":"shell","args_summary":"bash -c # Prepare best structures \u2014 copy/gunzip to accessible location\nmkdir -p /home/tjiang/repos/project_magnolia/opencode_cc_mem/projects/hsc70_new/analysis/6mer_stage1\n\n# ApKFERQ_N cluster 2 model 1 (top cluster)\ncp /home/tjiang/repos/project_magnolia/opencode_cc_mem/projects/hsc70_new/runs/2026-06-05_ApKFERQ_N_p2rank1_s5000/output/11_seletopclusts/cluster_2_model_1.pdb.gz /home/tjiang/repos/project_magnolia/opencode_cc_mem/projects/hsc70_new/analysis/6mer_stage1/\ngunzip -f /home/tjiang/repos/project_magnolia/opencode_cc_mem/projects/hsc70_new/analysis/6mer_stage1/cluster_2_model_1.pdb.gz\n\n# KFERQ parent cluster 1 model 1\ncp /home/tjiang/repos/project_magnolia/opencode_cc_mem/projects/hsc70_new/runs/2026-06-02_KFERQ_p2rank1_s5000/output/11_seletopclusts/cluster_1_model_1.pdb.gz /home/tjiang/repos/project_magnolia/opencode_cc_mem/projects/hsc70_new/analysis/6mer_stage1/\ngunzip -f /home/tjiang/repos/project_magnolia/opencode_cc_mem/projects/hsc70_new/analysis/6mer_stage1/cluster_1_model_1.pdb.gz\n\n# Also KFERQpA_C for C-term ALA comparison (cluster 5 has best DockQ=0.699)\ncp /home/tjiang/repos/project_magnolia/opencode_cc_mem/projects/hsc70_new/runs/2026-06-05_KFERQpA_C_p2rank1_s5000/output/11_seletopclusts/cluster_3_model_1.pdb.gz /home/tjiang/repos/project_magnolia/opencode_cc_mem/projects/hsc70_new/analysis/6mer_stage1/KFERQpA_C_clt3.pdb.gz\ngunzip -f /home/tjiang/repos/project_magnolia/opencode_cc_mem/projects/hsc70_new/analysis/6mer_stage1/KFERQpA_C_clt3.pdb.gz\n\nls -la /home/tjiang/repos/project_magnolia/opencode_cc_mem/projects/hsc70_new/analysis/6mer_stage1/"}
