{"event_type":"tool_call","timestamp":"2026-06-17T20:15:12.961800Z","session_id":"2026-05-15_155415","project_id":"opencode_cc_mem","source":"magnolia-run","tool":"shell","args_summary":"bash -c WD=projects/hsc70_new/runs/2026-06-17_mmgbsa_analysis/RKALQ_5mer\n\n# Create sander input for per-residue decomposition\ncat > ${WD}/sander_decomp.mdin << 'EOF'\nPer-residue energy decomposition\n &cntrl\n  ntb=0, nsnb=99999, cut=999.0, imin=5,\n  ncyc=0, igb=5, saltcon=0.15, gbsa=2,\n  surften=0.0072, extdiel=80.0,\n  idecomp=2,\n /\nResidues considered as REC\nRRES 1 646\nEND\nResidues considered as LIG\nLRES 647 651\nEND\nResidues to print\nRES 647 647\nRES 648 648\nRES 649 649\nRES 650 650\nRES 651 651\nEND\nEND\nEOF\n\n# Run sander\nSANDER=/home/tjiang/anaconda3/envs/ambertools/bin/sander\ncd ${WD}\n$SANDER -O -i sander_decomp.mdin \\\n    -p complex.prmtop \\\n    -c complex.rst7 \\\n    -o sander_decomp.out \\\n    -r restrt \\\n    -ref complex.rst7 > sander.log 2>&1\n\necho \"Sander exit: $?\"\nls -la sander_decomp.out 2>/dev/null"}
