{"event_type":"tool_call","timestamp":"2026-06-18T12:48:13.423223Z","session_id":"2026-05-15_155415","project_id":"opencode_cc_mem","source":"magnolia-run","tool":"shell","args_summary":"bash -c # Study the existing RKALQ MM-GBSA setup\necho \"=== tleap input ===\"\ncat projects/hsc70_new/runs/2026-06-17_mmgbsa_analysis/RKALQ_5mer/tleap.in\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== sander input ===\"\ncat projects/hsc70_new/runs/2026-06-17_mmgbsa_analysis/RKALQ_5mer/sander_decomp.mdin\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== cpptraj inputs ===\"\ncat projects/hsc70_new/runs/2026-06-17_mmgbsa_analysis/RKALQ_5mer/cpptraj.in\necho \"---\"\ncat projects/hsc70_new/runs/2026-06-17_mmgbsa_analysis/RKALQ_5mer/cpptraj2.in\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== How was the receptor and peptide PDB prepared? ===\"\necho \"Peptide PDB:\"\nhead -3 projects/hsc70_new/runs/2026-06-17_mmgbsa_analysis/RKALQ_5mer/peptide_raw.pdb\necho \"...\"\ngrep '^ATOM' projects/hsc70_new/runs/2026-06-17_mmgbsa_analysis/RKALQ_5mer/peptide_raw.pdb | tail -3\necho \"\"\necho \"Receptor PDB:\"\nhead -3 projects/hsc70_new/runs/2026-06-17_mmgbsa_analysis/RKALQ_5mer/receptor_raw.pdb\necho \"...\"\ngrep '^ATOM' projects/hsc70_new/runs/2026-06-17_mmgbsa_analysis/RKALQ_5mer/receptor_raw.pdb | tail -3"}
