t tutoring system combining a concept or prerequisite knowledge graph, \"\n   \"retrieval-augmented generation grounding of tutoring content in course source material, \"\n   \"Bloom taxonomy typed learning objectives, mastery-based progression gating, \"\n   \"and explainable, auditable, or provenance-tracked per-decision records; LLM-based and agentic systems 2019-2026\")\nout=call(\"build_kb_from_search\",{\"query\":q,\"kb_name\":\"studium_litscan\",\"max_results\":25,\n   \"databases\":[\"semantic_scholar\",\"openalex\",\"arxiv\",\"google_scholar\"],\"min_year\":2019,\n   \"screen_method\":\"rerank\",\"screen_threshold\":0.35,\"require_abstract\":True,\n   \"description\":\"Literature scan: systems similar to Studium (LWG grounded agentic tutoring)\",\n   \"create_if_missing\":True})\nopen(\"/tmp/build_raw.txt\",\"w\").write(out)\nprint(\"RAW LEN\",len(out))\ntry:\n    j=json.loads(out)\n    print(json.dumps(j,indent=1)[:1800])\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(out[:1500])\nPYEOF\ntimeout 560 python3 /tmp/mcp_build.py 2>&1 | head -80"}
